UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Some play that you should strain to interfere in an opponents' 2@C auction. Partner knows you don't have much in the way of high cards. I would bid 2@H over 2@D with the West hand although most would not. It turns out if you do, then you get a heart lead and end up with at least one more trick.|
