UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Perfect defense does beat 3N by one. When East leads low towards the @SJ, North can take the @SQ as the 2nd defensive trick. If North leads hearts (not easy to see), then the defense takes 3 heart tricks and beats 3N by one. But it is hard to defend perfectly which is why it pays to bid aggressively.|
PG| ***** 33 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Next, is how I might bid the West hand, particularly if I play |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at| 2N where a 2N bid asks for further description of the East hand.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 34 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|After West bids an |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at| 2N. East's responses are all artificial and describe her hand strength and suit strength. That is whether or not she has a good hand and a good suit.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 35 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A good suit is considered a suit with 2 of the top 3 honors and a good hand is considered 8 or more HCP.|
PG| ***** 36 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The responses to |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at| 2N are as follows:
^d 3@C = bad hand bad suit;
^d 3@D = bad hand good suit (and is the response East would make on this particular hand);
^d 3@H = good hand bad suit;
^d 3@S = good hand good suit.|
PG| ***** 37 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I would probably pass the 3@D response to |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at| since there are no likely entries to the East hand although because of the good suit, if West wanted to be aggressive, he could bid 3N hoping for a lot of luck.|
PG| ***** 38 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|If you wish, you can click the blue |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ogust,Ogust^*N|CP||FP||at| an study my tutorial made by Kia, the Movie Maker.
