mb|1C|mb|1N|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I agree with 1N by West. That shows 15-18 and a club stopper. West's hand is actually a bit stronger than 1N as it has 18 HCP with a 5-card quality suit. It is worth 20 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at|.|
