UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I mis-defended. At trick five I should lead a club back instead of the @DQ. Then I think we end up taking 7 tricks.|
PG| ***** 59 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Had I bid a double we probably end up in 2@S contract. 2@S probably is down one or two. So my decision to pass was fine. Had I defended correctly we would end up with a plus score.

|
