cp|8|AT|
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|True. The hand is worth a lot which is why 3@S is a big underbid. But you should assume East has a weak hand with 4 spades and, therefore, you should not bid 4@S. If his hand was strong enough for you to bid 4@S, then he should bid 3@H.|
